{"lessonId":37,"version":"32fb6aa598eb","questions":[{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:37:10","wordId":"distinguish-37","prompt":"Let me point out the features of our service that ________ our airline from our competitors.","answer":"distinguish","options":["distinguishably","distinguishable","distinguishing","distinguish"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:37:11","wordId":"economize-37","prompt":"Let's shop around until we find a more ________ airfare.","answer":"economical","options":["economical","economize","economy","economically"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:37:12","wordId":"expense-37","prompt":"We need to keep our ________ down so you'll have to find us better prices on airline tickets.","answer":"expenses","options":["expensiveness","expensively","expenses","expensive"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:37:13","wordId":"extend-37","prompt":"I decided not to ________ my trip since I felt so tired by the time I finished my business meetings.","answer":"extend","options":["extended","extent","extensive","extend"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:37:14","wordId":"prospective-37","prompt":"My travel agent said there were good ________ of finding a reasonably priced airfare.","answer":"prospects","options":["prospective","prospectively","prospectors","prospects"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:37:15","wordId":"substantially-37","prompt":"Unless the airfares differ ________, you should book seats on the airline with which you have frequent flyer miles.","answer":"substantially","options":["substance","substantially","substantial","substantiality"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:deal-with-37:1","wordId":"deal-with-37","prompt":"Sick passengers, frightened children, and rude pilots are just a few of the things cabin attendants have to ________.","answer":"deal with","options":["deal with","distinguish","economize","extend"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:destination-37:0","wordId":"destination-37","prompt":"The Great Barrier Reef is a popular tourist ________ this year.","answer":"destination","options":["destination","excursion","expense","situation"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:distinguish-37:0","wordId":"distinguish-37","prompt":"Suki was able to ________ between the different types of jets on the runway.","answer":"distinguish","options":["distinguish","deal with","economize","extend"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:economize-37:0","wordId":"economize-37","prompt":"My travel agent knows I like to ________ and always looks out for the best prices for me.","answer":"economize","options":["economize","deal with","distinguish","extend"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:equivalent-37:0","wordId":"equivalent-37","prompt":"Carlos used the Internet to search for hotels of ________ dollar value to the one recommended.","answer":"equivalent","options":["equivalent","prospective","substantially","valid"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:excursion-37:0","wordId":"excursion-37","prompt":"With some time between meetings in London, the company president enjoyed an ________ to Stonehenge.","answer":"excursion","options":["excursion","destination","expense","situation"],"sourceVersion":"32fb6aa598eb"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:prospective-37:0","wordId":"prospective-37","prompt":"The airline had a reception to impress travel agents who might be ________ clients.","answer":"prospective","options":["prospective","equivalent","substantially","valid"],"sourceVersio